{"title":"DEUTSCHE PUBNIGHT - monatliches Meetup","startsAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-05T22:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Our SIGNATURE event… come and join us for some pints of great German beer and European food, great networking or simply just a good time with great people.\nWe are meeting at the Sin & Redemption Pub, 136 McCaul Street - right across from AGO). Come, join us and enjoy a great selection of tasty beers, fine food and warm hospitality.\n\nDirections: [https://maps.app.goo.gl/qasCcCgkMth9dGf2A](https://maps.app.goo.gl/qasCcCgkMth9dGf2A)\n\nWe look forward to meeting you!\n\nGrüße,\nFrank the German (FtG)","venue":{"name":"Sin and Redemption","address":"136 McCaul St  Toronto ON                 M5T 1W2, Toronto","lat":43.65468,"lng":-79.391716,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"German Meetup Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/b/e/0/highres_530516288.jpeg"}